  "implementation_requirements": [
    "Target 40 layers only; preserve 3 draft layers native.",
    "Capture MXFP4 uint8 packed weights and UE8M0 scales before Humming repacking; convert scale exponents without re-quantizing FP4 payload.",
    "GC activation quantization is FP8 K128 with float32 scales, different from Humming dynamic_token; disclose and validate quantization error.",
    "Native MoE has EP8 local48, SP1, skip_final_all_reduce=false. GC must partition replicated input rows across EP ranks and restore full row order.",
    "Expose already-reduced routed output to MoERunner, so routed output is not summed a second time. Retain native separate shared TP reduction and routed scale application for routed-only initial integration.",
    "All-target no-silent-fallback policy avoids duplicating entire Humming and GC weight copies in GPU memory. Validate complete prefill/decode/verify capacity before service deployment.",
    "Multiple layers may share sequential symmetric workspace only after changing-weight-pointer graph/lifecycle validation.",
    "No kernel or service performance claim is established by this audit."
  ]
